    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/crdm/crdm-recorded-walkthrough.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Requirements from a recorded walkthrough",
      "prov:value": "It is also easy to\nover-trust, because a transcript reads like a record and is not one. This skill\nis what turned a 17-minute call into\n[the round 2 public-comment CRD](../../../docs/proposals/public-comment-round-2-crd-2026-10-06.md)\n(bean `uphx`), and every rule below was paid for there.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean uphx",
        "docs/proposals/public-comment-round-2-crd-2026-10-06.md",
        "2026-10-06"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/crdm/crdm-recorded-walkthrough.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "1. Inventory what was actually uploaded",
      "prov:value": "List the files before promising anything. On 2026-10-06 the first upload was a\nTeams `.docx` and a `.vtt`; the request said \"there is video\", and there was\nnone. The `.docx`'s 86 images were speaker avatars, not screen content.\n**A Teams .docx transcript never contains the shared screen.** Say what is\nmissing, do what can be done, and list what waits for the missing file.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/crdm/crdm-recorded-walkthrough.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "4. Screenshots: where the screen changed and where a speaker points",
      "prov:value": "4. **Look at every frame you keep.** On 2026-10-06, a frame cut for \"the type\n   dropdown\" also showed the defect itself (the counter read \"12 of 2632\n   shown\" while the table above it had not changed), and the frame of the\n   new-change-set form showed REQ-10 was half-built already (\"Only the\n   review committee and the editor can create a change-set\"). Both changed\n   the requirements document.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/crdm/crdm-recorded-walkthrough.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "5. From transcript to requirements",
      "prov:value": "- **Who signs off is part of the requirement set.** The owner ruled\n  2026-10-06 that the chief editor signs off before anything merges or is\n  built. Ask who it is if the recording does not say.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-06"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
